	"smallSizeObservation": {
		"en": "At 128/64 px the tiered roofs, obsidian base and emerald/amber accents establish the tower. At 32/24/16 px the transparent mark relies on the stepped architectural silhouette; tiny ruby inlays, railings and gold details naturally merge.",
		"zh": "128/64 px 以重檐、黑曜石底座和祖母绿、琥珀点缀建立角楼形象；32/24/16 px 透明标记依靠层叠建筑剪影，细小红宝石、栏杆与金色细节自然合并。"
	}
